Recommends: magnolie-organizer (>= 2.0.0)
Description: Illustrated user handbook for Magnolie Organizer
 The complete handbook for Magnolie Organizer, presented like the application
 itself: an open landscape-format book with a brown leather cover, ring binding,
 and folded page corners for turning pages.
 .
 It explains every feature in full sentences, including appointments, addresses,
 tasks, notes, anniversaries, reminders, holidays, Lotus Organizer migration,
 Magnolienbaum, updates, the recycle bin, password protection, and backups.
 English and German editions include examples, step-by-step instructions, and
 illustrations for readers without prior experience.
 .
 A clickable table of contents links to every chapter. The entire handbook can
 be printed on A4 with safe margins or saved as a PDF file.
